<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero__content">
    <p class="eyebrow">VOICE RECIPE</p>
    <h1>聴きながら、<br><span>もっとおいしく。</span></h1>
    <p class="hero__description">
      オトレピは、材料と手順を声で案内するレシピアプリ。<br class="desktop-only">
      画面に触れず、自分のペースで料理を進められます。
    </p>
    <div class="hero__actions">
      <%= link_to recipes_path, class: "btn btn-main btn-large" do %>
        レシピを見つける <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      <% end %>
      <%= link_to new_recipe_path, class: "btn btn-ghost btn-large" do %>
        自分のレシピを書く
      <% end %>
    </div>
    <div class="hero__note"><span aria-hidden="true">●</span> ブラウザの音声機能ですぐに使えます</div>
  </div>

  <div class="hero__visual" aria-label="読み上げ画面のイメージ">
    <div class="sound-wave sound-wave--one"></div>
    <div class="sound-wave sound-wave--two"></div>
    <div class="preview-card">
      <div class="preview-card__top">
        <span class="preview-card__label">COOKING NOW</span>
        <span class="preview-card__emoji" aria-hidden="true">🍳</span>
      </div>
      <p class="preview-card__recipe">ふわとろ親子丼</p>
      <p class="preview-card__counter">STEP 3 / 5</p>
      <p class="preview-card__step">溶き卵を2回に分けて<br>ゆっくり回し入れます。</p>
      <div class="preview-card__player">
        <span class="preview-card__play" aria-hidden="true">▶</span>
        <div class="preview-card__progress"><span></span></div>
        <span class="preview-card__time">0:08</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="feature-section page-section">
  <div class="section-heading section-heading--center">
    <p class="eyebrow">HOW IT HELPS</p>
    <h2>料理の「ちょっと困る」を、声で解決</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="feature-grid">
    <article class="feature-card">
      <span class="feature-card__icon" aria-hidden="true">👂</span>
      <h3>耳で手順を確認</h3>
      <p>濡れた手でスマホに触れず、次の工程を音声でチェックできます。</p>
    </article>
    <article class="feature-card">
      <span class="feature-card__icon feature-card__icon--green" aria-hidden="true">↔</span>
      <h3>自分のペースで進む</h3>
      <p>「次へ」「もう一度」「戻る」を使って、慌てずに調理できます。</p>
    </article>
    <article class="feature-card">
      <span class="feature-card__icon feature-card__icon--yellow" aria-hidden="true">✎</span>
      <h3>自分のレシピを登録</h3>
      <p>いつもの作り方を保存して、読み上げやすい自分だけの料理ノートに。</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<% if @sample_recipes.any? %>
  <section class="sample-section page-section">
    <div class="section-heading section-heading--split">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">TRY IT NOW</p>
        <h2>まずは、このレシピから</h2>
      </div>
      <%= link_to "すべてのレシピを見る →", recipes_path, class: "text-link" %>
    </div>
    <div class="recipe-grid">
      <%= render partial: "recipe_card", collection: @sample_recipes, as: :recipe, locals: { owner_actions: false } %>
    </div>
  </section>
<% end %>

<section class="cta-banner page-section">
  <div>
    <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--light">YOUR KITCHEN, YOUR PACE</p>
    <h2>いつものレシピを、もっと作りやすく。</h2>
    <p>無料登録して、あなたの料理ノートをはじめましょう。</p>
  </div>
  <%= link_to user_signed_in? ? new_recipe_path : new_user_registration_path, class: "btn btn-light btn-large" do %>
    <%= user_signed_in? ? "レシピを書く" : "無料ではじめる" %> <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
  <% end %>
</section>
